#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.1"
msgstr "v3.6.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.1 is a big release. It introduces the :mod:`imu` module (LSM6DS3), a "
"suite of new :mod:`sensor` getter APIs with **IMU-driven auto-rotation**, "
"4-point perspective ``rotation_corr()``, and brings up the **Arduino "
"Portenta H7** with the **HIMAX HM01B0** and **OV7690** cameras. Several "
":mod:`sensor` / :mod:`image` APIs changed and TensorFlow was dropped on the "
"M7 — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.1 是一次重大发布。它引入了 :mod:`imu` 模块（LSM6DS3）、一套全新的 :mod:`sensor` getter API（带有"
" **IMU 驱动的自动旋转**\\ ）、4 点透视 ``rotation_corr()``\\ ，并使 **Arduino Portenta H7**"
" 配合 **HIMAX HM01B0** 和 **OV7690** 摄像头投入运行。多个 :mod:`sensor` / :mod:`image` "
"API 发生了变化，且 M7 上移除了 TensorFlow——请阅读下方的破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "重点内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:21
msgid ""
":mod:`imu` module — accelerometer / gyro / temperature / roll / pitch on the"
" LSM6DS3 (OpenMV 4 / Portenta)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`imu` 模块——LSM6DS3（OpenMV 4 / Portenta）上的加速度计 / 陀螺仪 / 温度 / 横滚 / 俯仰。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Sensor getters + auto-rotation** — ``get_pixformat()`` / "
"``get_framesize()`` / ``get_hmirror()`` / ``get_vflip()`` / "
"``get_windowing()``, ``set_transpose()`` / ``set_auto_rotation()``, and IMU-"
"driven snapshot rotation."
msgstr ""
"**传感器 getter + 自动旋转**\\ ——\\ ``get_pixformat()`` / ``get_framesize()`` / "
"``get_hmirror()`` / ``get_vflip()`` / ``get_windowing()``\\ 、\\ "
"``set_transpose()`` / ``set_auto_rotation()``\\ ，以及 IMU 驱动的快照旋转。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Perspective correction** — ``rotation_corr()`` gains ``fov`` and "
"``corners`` (4-point) keywords."
msgstr "**透视校正**\\ ——\\ ``rotation_corr()`` 新增 ``fov`` 和 ``corners``\\ （4 点）关键字参数。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:29
msgid ""
"**New hardware** — Arduino Portenta H7, HIMAX HM01B0, and OV7690 camera."
msgstr "**新硬件**\\ ——Arduino Portenta H7、HIMAX HM01B0 和 OV7690 摄像头。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``set_pixformat()`` / ``set_framesize()`` now return ``None``,"
" :func:`sensor.set_framerate` was removed, TensorFlow was dropped on the M7,"
" and ``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` now require even dimensions — see the "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**破坏性变更：** ``set_pixformat()`` / ``set_framesize()`` 现在返回 ``None``\\ ，\\ "
":func:`sensor.set_framerate` 被移除，M7 上移除了 TensorFlow，且 ``lens_corr()`` / "
"``linpolar()`` 现在要求偶数尺寸——参见破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:36
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:38
msgid ""
":mod:`imu` — a new IMU module: :func:`imu.acceleration_mg`, "
":func:`imu.angular_rate_mdps`, :func:`imu.temperature_c`, :func:`imu.roll`, "
":func:`imu.pitch`, and :func:`imu.sleep` (LSM6DS3 on OpenMV 4 / Portenta)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`imu`\\ ——全新的 IMU 模块：\\ :func:`imu.acceleration_mg`\\ 、\\ "
":func:`imu.angular_rate_mdps`\\ 、\\ :func:`imu.temperature_c`\\ 、\\ "
":func:`imu.roll`\\ 、\\ :func:`imu.pitch` 和 :func:`imu.sleep`\\ （OpenMV 4 / "
"Portenta 上的 LSM6DS3）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Sensor getters** — added :func:`sensor.get_pixformat`, "
"``get_framesize()``, ``get_hmirror()``, ``get_vflip()``, "
"``get_windowing()``, ``set_transpose()`` / ``get_transpose()``, and "
"``set_auto_rotation()`` / ``get_auto_rotation()``."
msgstr ""
"**传感器 getter**\\ ——新增 :func:`sensor.get_pixformat`\\ 、\\ "
"``get_framesize()``\\ 、\\ ``get_hmirror()``\\ 、\\ ``get_vflip()``\\ 、\\ "
"``get_windowing()``\\ 、\\ ``set_transpose()`` / ``get_transpose()``\\ ，以及 "
"``set_auto_rotation()`` / ``get_auto_rotation()``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Auto-rotation** — :func:`sensor.snapshot` uses the IMU to flip / mirror / "
"transpose frames when auto-rotation is enabled."
msgstr "**自动旋转**\\ ——启用自动旋转后，\\ :func:`sensor.snapshot` 会利用 IMU 对帧进行翻转 / 镜像 / 转置。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:47
msgid ""
"``rotation_corr()`` — added ``fov`` and ``corners`` (4-point perspective) "
"keywords, with perspective-correction examples."
msgstr ""
"``rotation_corr()``\\ ——新增 ``fov`` 和 ``corners``\\ （4 点透视）关键字参数，并附有透视校正示例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:49
msgid "``lcd.init()`` — added a ``bgr`` keyword argument."
msgstr "``lcd.init()``\\ ——新增 ``bgr`` 关键字参数。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:50
msgid ":class:`collections.deque` — enabled in the MicroPython build."
msgstr ":class:`collections.deque`\\ ——在 MicroPython 构建中启用。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:51
msgid ""
"Added ``sensor.OV7690`` and ``sensor.HM01B0`` id constants and a numpy-like "
":mod:`ulab` image-filter example."
msgstr ""
"新增 ``sensor.OV7690`` 和 ``sensor.HM01B0`` id 常量，以及一个类似 numpy 的 :mod:`ulab` "
"图像滤波示例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:55
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Significantly optimized the image filters (median / mode / mean / …) and "
"``find_circles()`` and lens correction; ``alloc_extra_fb`` can now allocate "
"any number of bytes; the person-detection model was rebuilt with a new "
"average-pool op."
msgstr ""
"大幅优化了图像滤波器（median / mode / mean / …）以及 ``find_circles()`` 和镜头校正；\\ "
"``alloc_extra_fb`` 现在可以分配任意字节数；人体检测模型采用新的 average-pool 算子重新构建。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:63
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Bug 修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:65
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "摄像头与传感器："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:67
msgid ""
"Fixed OV2640 ``sleep()`` (now uses the COM2 standby register instead of the "
"power-down pin), the FSYNC pin configuration, the HM01B0 HSYNC/VSYNC "
"polarities and I2C address/scanning, the Portenta sensor power-down GPIO and"
" camera reset pin, and disabled auto-rotation when the IMU pitch is near "
"90°/270°."
msgstr ""
"修复了 OV2640 ``sleep()``\\ （现在使用 COM2 待机寄存器而非掉电引脚）、FSYNC 引脚配置、HM01B0 的 "
"HSYNC/VSYNC 极性和 I2C 地址/扫描、Portenta 传感器掉电 GPIO 和摄像头复位引脚，并在 IMU 俯仰角接近 90°/270°"
" 时禁用自动旋转。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:73
msgid "Imaging and system:"
msgstr "成像与系统："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:75
msgid ""
"Fixed an image-filter boundary-check bug, a hardfault when disabling the "
"D-cache, booting on boards without an SD card, a ``tf.load()`` "
"``load_to_fb`` bug, the person-detection stack overflow (H7 stack raised to "
"≥12 KB), and the USB descriptor offsets for high-speed mode on the OpenMV 4 "
"Plus."
msgstr ""
"修复了一个图像滤波边界检查 bug、禁用 D-cache 时的硬故障、无 SD 卡的板卡上的启动问题、一个 ``tf.load()`` 的 "
"``load_to_fb`` bug、人体检测栈溢出（H7 栈提升至 ≥12 KB），以及 OpenMV 4 Plus 上高速模式的 USB "
"描述符偏移问题。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:82
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与板卡支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — initial board bring-up (STM32H747 clock/OSC/HSE "
"config, CMSIS headers, ADC, SDRAM, Arduino USB PID)."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7**\\ ——初始板卡启用（STM32H747 时钟/OSC/HSE 配置、CMSIS "
"头文件、ADC、SDRAM、Arduino USB PID）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:86
msgid ""
"**HIMAX HM01B0** — new monochrome camera driver (Bayer, external-oscillator "
"clock)."
msgstr "**HIMAX HM01B0**\\ ——全新的单色摄像头驱动（Bayer、外部振荡器时钟）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:88
msgid "**OV7690** — new camera driver."
msgstr "**OV7690**\\ ——全新的摄像头驱动。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:89
msgid "**LSM6DS3 IMU** — OpenMV 4 / Portenta."
msgstr "**LSM6DS3 IMU**\\ ——OpenMV 4 / Portenta。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:92
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 变更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:94
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.6.0 and v3.6.1. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.0 与 v3.6.1 之间面向用户的 API 破坏性变更。范围：\\ ``modules/`` 中的 Python C 模块和 "
"``scripts/libraries/`` 中的 Python 库。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:97
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "每项变更都标注了其影响："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:99
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor*\\ ——窄范围 API；只影响使用过它的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:100
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr "*behavior*\\ ——相同 API，不同结果；请重新检查经过调优的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:102
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_6_1_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"各项变更按上述顺序依影响分组。如果你只想移植代码，请直接跳到末尾的 :ref:`迁移检查清单 <v3_6_1_migration>`\\ "
"。每个提交哈希都链接到其在 GitHub 上的 diff。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:109
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_framerate` removed *(minor)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.set_framerate` 被移除 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:111
msgid ""
"The no-op :func:`sensor.set_framerate` stub was removed; calling it now "
"raises ``AttributeError``. Remove the call and control frame timing via "
"framesize/exposure instead. (A working ``set_framerate()`` is re-introduced "
"in v4.0.2.)"
msgstr ""
"无操作的 :func:`sensor.set_framerate` 占位函数被移除；现在调用它会引发 ``AttributeError``\\ "
"。请移除该调用，改为通过 framesize/exposure 控制帧时序。（可用的 ``set_framerate()`` 在 v4.0.2 "
"中重新引入。）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:116
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `705e98f91 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/705e98f91>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `705e98f91 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/705e98f91>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:121
msgid "TensorFlow dropped on the OpenMV Cam M7 *(minor)*"
msgstr "OpenMV Cam M7 上移除 TensorFlow *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:123
msgid ""
"TensorFlow (the ``tf`` module) was disabled on the OpenMV Cam M7 / OpenMV 3 "
"(it no longer fits). ``import tf`` on the M7 fails — use an H7-class camera "
"for TensorFlow. (``tf`` is re-enabled on the F7 in v3.6.3.)"
msgstr ""
"TensorFlow（\\ ``tf`` 模块）在 OpenMV Cam M7 / OpenMV 3 上被禁用（已无法容纳）。在 M7 上执行 "
"``import tf`` 会失败——请使用 H7 级摄像头来运行 TensorFlow。（\\ ``tf`` 在 v3.6.3 中于 F7 "
"上重新启用。）"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:127
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `2ae875077 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2ae875077>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `2ae875077 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2ae875077>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:132
msgid "``set_pixformat()`` / ``set_framesize()`` return ``None`` *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``set_pixformat()`` / ``set_framesize()`` 返回 ``None`` *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:134
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` and :func:`sensor.set_framesize` now return "
"``None`` instead of ``True``, and an unsupported pixel format now raises a "
"``ValueError`` instead of an assertion. Code that checked the return value "
"(e.g. ``if sensor.set_pixformat(...):``) must stop doing so, and code that "
"caught ``AssertionError`` for unsupported formats must catch ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_pixformat` 和 :func:`sensor.set_framesize` 现在返回 ``None`` 而非"
" ``True``\\ ，且不支持的像素格式现在会引发 ``ValueError`` 而非断言错误。检查返回值的代码（例如 ``if "
"sensor.set_pixformat(...):``\\ ）必须不再这样做，捕获 ``AssertionError`` "
"以处理不支持格式的代码必须改为捕获 ``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:140
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f314ac4e7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f314ac4e7>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `f314ac4e7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f314ac4e7>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:145
msgid ""
"``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / ``logpolar()`` require even dimensions "
"*(behavior)*"
msgstr "``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / ``logpolar()`` 要求偶数尺寸 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:147
msgid ""
"``image.lens_corr()`` and ``image.linpolar()`` / ``image.logpolar()`` now "
"require even image width and height and raise an error on odd dimensions. "
"Crop or resize the image to even dimensions before calling these methods."
msgstr ""
"``image.lens_corr()`` 以及 ``image.linpolar()`` / ``image.logpolar()`` "
"现在要求图像宽度和高度均为偶数，奇数尺寸会引发错误。在调用这些方法前，请将图像裁剪或缩放为偶数尺寸。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:151
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b36460a36 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b36460a36>`__, `2b26ca17b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2b26ca17b>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `b36460a36 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b36460a36>`__\\ "
"、\\ `2b26ca17b <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/2b26ca17b>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:157
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "迁移检查清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:159
msgid "For a clean port to v3.6.1 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要干净地移植到 v3.6.1，典型的工作是："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:161
msgid ""
"Remove :func:`sensor.set_framerate` calls (:ref:`the set_framerate removal "
"<v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."
msgstr ""
"移除 :func:`sensor.set_framerate` 调用（\\ :ref:`set_framerate 移除 "
"<v3_6_1_setframerate>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:163
msgid ""
"Move TensorFlow workloads off the OpenMV Cam M7 (:ref:`the M7 TensorFlow "
"change <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."
msgstr ""
"将 TensorFlow 工作负载迁离 OpenMV Cam M7（\\ :ref:`M7 TensorFlow 变更 <v3_6_1_tfm7>`\\"
" ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:165
msgid ""
"Stop relying on the return value of ``set_pixformat()`` / "
"``set_framesize()`` and catch ``ValueError`` for unsupported pixel formats "
"(:ref:`the return-value change <v3_6_1_setreturn>`)."
msgstr ""
"不再依赖 ``set_pixformat()`` / ``set_framesize()`` 的返回值，并为不支持的像素格式捕获 "
"``ValueError``\\ （\\ :ref:`返回值变更 <v3_6_1_setreturn>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:168
msgid ""
"Ensure even image dimensions before ``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / "
"``logpolar()`` (:ref:`the even-dimension requirement <v3_6_1_evendims>`)."
msgstr ""
"在调用 ``lens_corr()`` / ``linpolar()`` / ``logpolar()`` 前确保图像尺寸为偶数（\\ "
":ref:`偶数尺寸要求 <v3_6_1_evendims>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:171
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "所有其他脚本无需更改即可运行。"
